Revision history for Test-JSON-Diff

0.02      2026-09-29 15:41:00 -0600
  - fix _diff to no longer be affected by a caller's ambient $/ (input
    record separator); a caller that left $/ set to undef (or any other
    non-default value) could previously cause a false failure report for
    two JSON documents that are actually the same

